sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Material batch
  participant C as Coupon lab
  participant D as Dosimetry
  participant S as Safety reviewer
  participant T as Thermal/mechanical lab
  M->>C: Document composition, density and geometry
  C->>S: Batch traceability and nonliving status
  S-->>D: Permit declared calibration test
  D->>C: Spectrum-specific exposure and dosimetry
  C->>S: Transmitted dose, secondary signatures and alarms
  alt acceptance checks pass
    S-->>T: Permit aging and integration tests
    T->>S: Thermal, strain, moisture and post-test chemistry
  else any failed or unknown result
    S-->>C: Stop, isolate and reframe
  end

